WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.710
Every survey starts on the Surveys page.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.390
Click New Survey, then choose a template,

3
00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.590
so you never begin from a blank page.

4
00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.830
Formbricks has ready-made surveys for the most common

5
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.430
feedback jobs, from product fit to churn.

6
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.380
Browse templates by channel,

7
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.680
industry, or role.

8
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.360
Product Market Fit is a good one for a

9
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.580
SaaS app like Tidepool.

10
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.200
Click it, and a live preview appears on the

11
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:24.440
right.

12
00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:26.953
Happy with the questions?

13
00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:28.513
Click Use this template.

14
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.213
It opens in the editor, and you can change

15
00:00:31.213 --> 00:00:34.073
any question, add more, or remove the ones you

16
00:00:34.073 --> 00:00:34.733
do not need.

17
00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.893
Every question is already written,

18
00:00:37.893 --> 00:00:39.993
and the preview updates as you edit.

19
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.813
Click the survey name at the top and call

20
00:00:42.813 --> 00:00:44.513
it Tidepool PMF pulse.

21
00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:46.987
When you are happy with it,

22
00:00:47.187 --> 00:00:47.927
click Activate.

23
00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.407
Formbricks saves your changes as you go,

24
00:00:50.587 --> 00:00:51.707
so nothing is lost.

25
00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:54.427
Your survey is live.

26
00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.187
Click Copy, and the link is ready to paste

27
00:00:57.187 --> 00:00:59.587
into an email, a chat, or your website.

28
00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:02.507
Anyone who opens it can answer in seconds,

29
00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:03.787
with no account needed.
